retty Derby (VG) - Tio Plato - The Legend of Heroes Series (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95156-7tw0zP396ecG.png'),(1474,'Miyuki Sawashiro','[Profile](https://www.aoni.co.jp/search/sawashiro-miyuki.html) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miyuki_Sawashiro) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B2%A2%E5%9F%8E%E3%81%BF%E3%82%86%E3%81%8D) Miyuki Sawashiro began her voice-acting career in 1999 and has continued her work as a seiyuu for more than two decades. Her younger brother [Chiharu Sawashiro](https://anilist.co/staff/120159) is also a voice actor. One of Miyuki\'s hobbies is playing piano.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95099-jKP4LfPWqetk.jpg'),(1475,'Yui Horie','[Website](http://king-cr.jp/artist/horie/) | [Profile](https://www.vims.co.jp/talent_profile_detail.php?id=8) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/horieyui-blog/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/horieyui_staff) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/yuihorie_official/) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yui_Horie) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A0%80%E6%B1%9F%E7%94%B1%E8%A1%A3) | [Anison](http://anison.info/data/person/4000.html) | [Youtube](https://www.youtube.com/user/YuiHorieJP) She is a voice actress and singer currently affiliated with vims. She hosts a radio show called \"Horie Yui no Tenshi no Tamago\" (堀江由衣の天使のたまご \"Yui Horie\'s Angel Eggs\") and is the founding member of the singing group, Aice5. She is also a member of the band Kurobara Hozonkai, with the name YUIEL.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95028-MHT1m3E5wGZx.png'),(1476,'Akiyuki Shinbou','[Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/新房昭之) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Akiyuki_Shinbo) Akiyuki Shinbou is a Japanese director, producer, animator and storyboard artist. He joined Studio One Pattern in 1981. He made his directorial debut with [Metal Fighter Miku](https://anilist.co/anime/1175/) in 1994. He joined Shaft in 2004. He has received the 11th Tokyo Anime Award and the 2011 Newtype Anime Award for Best director for his work on the acclaimed anime series [Puella Magi Madoka Magica](https://anilist.co/anime/9756/). Shinbou was born in Fukushima Prefecture. After high school, he attended Tokyo Designer Institute before entering the anime industry.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n100089-SFwZPtWrncoa.png'),(1477,'Tomoyuki Itamura','Originating from [OLM](https://anilist.co/studio/28/), which he left to join [Shaft](https://anilist.co/studio/44/) in 2007. In 2012, Itamura succeeded [Tatsuya Oishi](https://anilist.co/staff/103552/) as the director of the Monogatari series following Oishi\'s decision to adapt the Kizumonogatari novels as [movies](https://anilist.co/anime/9260/). Beginning with [Nisemonogatari](https://anilist.co/anime/11597/), Itamura directed all subsequent televised installments of the series under [Akiyuki Shinbou](https://anilist.co/staff/100089/)\'s supervision, and after that left Shaft in 2017. More recently Itamura has been seen working on [Bones](https://anilist.co/studio/4/)\' shows, with [Vanitas no Carte](https://anilist.co/anime/131646/) being his first directorial work there.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n110639-PZgSNmNqMTZ7.png'),(1478,'Asuna Tomari','**Non-anime roles:** • Skuld - Memento Mori (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n129351-XYMaAkroHj8S.jpg'),(1479,'Manaka Iwami','[Profile](https://www.raccoon-dog.co.jp/talent/r10-iwami.html) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/_manaka_430) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9F%B3%E8%A6%8B%E8%88%9E%E8%8F%9C%E9%A6%99) **Non-Anime Roles:** - Saki Kashiwagi - O.N.G.E.K.I (VG) - Radola - Gyakuten Othellonia (VG) - Amber - Genshin Impact (VG) - Bridget - Guilty Gear -STRIVE- (VG) - MAI - Final Fantasy VII Rebirth (VG) - Piper Wheel - Zenless Zone Zero (VG) - Hikari - Blue Archive (VG) - Hysilens - Honkai: Star Rail (VG) - Mornye - Wuthering Waves (VG) - Utsusemi Tsukimi - Riichi City (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n121821-tQSkHZEuB3XH.png'),(1480,'Mari Hino','[Profile](https://sigma7.co.jp/actors/hino_mari) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/mhinom/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/mmmhinommm)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119707-gZ4Zew3Pdulp.png'),(1481,'Maaya Sakamoto','[Official Website](http://www.jvcmusic.co.jp/maaya/) | [LINE Blog](https://lineblog.me/sakamotomaaya/) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/user/maayasakamotoCh) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maaya_Sakamoto) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9D%82%E6%9C%AC%E7%9C%9F%E7%B6%BE) Married frequent costar [Kenichi Suzumura](https://anilist.co/staff/95005) on August 8, 2011. - [Maki Harukawa](https://anilist.co/character/131656/Maki-Harukawa) - Danganronpa V3 (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95090-oARRP42NEhu0.jpg'),(1482,'Makoto Furukawa','[Profile](http://www.toysfactory.co.jp/artist/makotofurukawa/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/m_furukawa929) **Non-Anime Roles**:','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n112635-ORlGvRvgf5Nq.png'),(1483,'Satomi Satou','[Profile (AXL-ONE)](https://axl-one.com/talent/sato.htmll) | [Blog](http://ameblo.jp/sato-satomi58) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/satosatomi58) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/sugar_me58/) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Satomi_Satō) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/佐藤聡美) She is a voice actress from Miyagi Prefecture, Japan currently affiliated with AXL-ONE. She is a graduate of Tokyo Announce Gakuin Performing Arts College. She is also known as Sugar (しゅがぁ, Shugā). She announced her marriage with fellow voice actor, [Takuma Terashima](https://anilist.co/staff/95494/), on July 6, 2017. Non-anime roles:','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n101560-YN8w6EZZtIhb.jpg'),(1484,'Yoshihide Ibata','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/yoshihide_ibata)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119574-VQ1eB4ZsyRRM.jpg'),(1485,'Mariya Ise','**[Profile (Across Entertainment)](http://across-ent.com/talent/women/mariya_ise.html) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/Ma_ri_ya_i) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/mariya_ise/) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/mariya-i/)** **Mariya Ise** is a Japanese actress and singer affiliated with Across Entertainment. **Non-Anime Roles:** - Camellya - Wuthering Waves (VG) - Magallan - Arknights (VG) - Mecklenburg - Azur Lane (VG) - Leo - Epic Seven (VG) - Wendy - Path to Nowhere (VG) - Raeon - Echocalypse: The Scarlet Covenant (VG) - Reo Kamiyama - Persona 5: The Phantom X (VG) - Farrah - Granblue Fantasy (VG) - Helel ben Shalem - Granblue Fantasy Versus: Rising (VG) - Crazy Taxi - 404 Game RE: SET (VG) - Lilyiro - Soul Tide (VG) - Lupina - Guardian Tales (VG) - Kudan - The Caligula Effect 2 (VG) -…','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95655-cR519BXmteKA.png'),(1486,'Rikiya Koyama',NULL,'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95113-z9eyYjTKSTX4.png'),(1487,'Masaya Matsukaze','[Profile](https://www.aoni.co.jp/search/matsukaze-masaya.html) | [Twitter ](https://twitter.com/matsukazest) Masaya Matsukaze is a Japanese actor, voice actor and radio personality. He was formerly affiliated with Big Apple, Radix Mobanimation Multicye Division and Varoque Works, and is currently affiliated with Aoni Production. He was born in Fukushima Prefecture and is now living in Tokyo. He is married to Emika Umemoto (ex-dental assistant) since August 2003. **Non-Anime Roles:**','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95042-gEcEYD7iDXnF.png'),(1488,'Hiroshi Koujina','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/hiroshikoujina) The representative director of Studio Live.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n105223-mb3Ek3cd3bTR.png'),(1489,'Tomokazu Sugita','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/sugitaLOV) | [Youtube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbPVSXP89cDlsiMf0jet1zQ) **Non-Anime Roles:**','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95002-nDIvHaynicEg.png'),(1490,'Natsumi Takamori','She is a Japanese voice actress affiliated with Pro Fit seiyuu management agency. [Profile](http://www.pro-fit.co.jp/talent_takamori.html) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/takamori_723) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Natsumi_Takamori) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%AB%98%E6%A3%AE%E5%A5%88%E6%B4%A5%E7%BE%8E) **Non-Anime Roles:**','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n106659-3LfNtHDY3P0Z.png'),(1491,'Youichi Fujita','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/i/user/58120205) Originating from [Sunrise](https://anilist.co/studio/14/). He first came to prominence as the director who overtook [Shinji Takamatsu](https://anilist.co/staff/100152/) on [Gintama](https://anilist.co/anime/918/) from episode 100 onwards. He stepped down from the role after the [2013 movie](https://anilist.co/anime/15335/), but remained as a supervisor for the series until the end. Also known for series such as [Osomatsu-san](https://anilist.co/anime/21261/) and [Binbougami ga!](https://anilist.co/anime/13535/).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n107437-tOtrCkQn1AFs.png'),(1492,'Kengo Kawanishi','[Profile (Mausu)](https://mausu.net/talent/kawanishi-kengo.html) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/kengokawanishi) **Non-anime roles:** - Cyros - Ash Echoes (VG) - Aventurine - Honkai: Star Rail (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n110877-8mqVadVTaFl4.png'),(1493,'Ai Kayano','**Height:** 153 cm (5\'0) __[Profile (Osawa)](https://osawa-inc.co.jp/women/kayanoai/) | [Official Twitter](https://twitter.com/_kayanomi) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/kayanoai_0913) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/kayanoai_0913/) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0D6qi-Gr5RW7hqOvTEKmAw)__ Ai Kayano is a Japanese voice actress and vocalist currently affiliated with Office Osawa. Kayano wanted to work in a job that would involve \"healing people\", leading to initially take up a course at a vocational school. She worked in the beauty industry and became interested in acting after having seen [Aria](https://anilist.co/anime/477/). While attending school, Kayano continued working in the industry and paid for her tuition.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n105765-DDK94me8axVv.png'),(1494,'Misaki Kuno','She is affiliated to talent agency Office Restart. [Profile (Office Restart)](https://endless-glory.com/talent_mk/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/kuno_misaki0119) - Klee - Genshin Impact (VG) - Mirabilis - Fire Emblem Heroes (VG) - Cocoa - Goddess of Victory: Nikke (VG) - Achates - Epic 7 (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n106641-zsyRkJ74NXvE.png'),(1495,'Tooru Ookawa','[Profile](https://mausu.net/talent/okawa-toru.html) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tōru_Ōkawa) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/大川透) He is an actor, voice actor and narrator. He is currently affiliated with Mausu Promotion. He is a Hanshin Tigers fan. His \"Kojirou\" alias is not to be confused with [Akito Sakuragi](https://anilist.co/staff/125572)\'s alias (they have different kanji at the end).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95243-zhk18RRqSAmx.png'),(1496,'Kenjirou Okada','Originating from [Group TAC](https://anilist.co/studio/86/).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n142260-ni88hzBDulGz.jpg'),(1497,'Shou Hayami','[Profile](http://edenzfeel.com/rushstyle/?talent=%E9%80%9F%E6%B0%B4-%E5%A5%A8) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/show_ism) | [Anison](http://anison.info/data/person/3674.html) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Show_Hayami) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%80%9F%E6%B0%B4%E5%A5%A8) He is a veteran voice actor and singer. His real name is Yasushi Oohama (大濱靖). He is married to fellow voice actress [Rei Igarashi](https://anilist.co/staff/102524).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95137-2Q5l3Br9G7sk.png'),(1498,'Satoshi Hino','**Height:** 170 cm **Skills:** English, kendo (1st dan) **Agency:** Axl-One [Blog](http://ameblo.jp/satoshi-hino) | [Profile](http://www.axl-one.com/talent/hino.html) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/Hino_Satoshi_84) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/hino_satoshi_84) Married to voice actress [Saki Nakajima](https://anilist.co/staff/95329/Saki-Nakajima). He has also voiced many non-anime roles like Benjamin Hornigold in _Assassin\'s Creed IV: Black Flag_ (video game), Cedric Diggory in _Harry Potter and the Goblet of Fire_ (Hollywood film), and Ron Stoppable in _Kim Possible_ (American cartoon). **Non-anime roles:** -Phainon (Honkai: Star Rail) -Kevin Kaslana (Honkai Impact 3rd) -Hung (Arknights)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95245-prBoWpg0HaGX.jpg'),(1499,'Aoi Koga','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/824_aoi) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/koga_aoi0824/) | [Agency Profile](https://www.81produce.co.jp/actor_search/index.php/item?id=199) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/古賀葵) Aoi Koga is a Japanese voice actress affiliated with 81 Produce. Koga had an interest in anime since her childhood, watching series such as Cardcaptor Sakura and Ojamajo Doremi. She first became interested in voice acting after watching the television program Okaasan to Issho and becoming fond of the puppet segments featured in the show. This made her want to \"become friends with dolls\" and, along with her interest in anime, helped her decide to pursue a career in entertainment.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n123268-zIZLjZ5Xfbk4.png'),(1500,'Konomi Kohara','[Profile](http://osawa-inc.co.jp/women/koharakonomi/) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/konomi_kohara0628/) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-mDMYpO-cIimTdXreTQdpA) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/koharakonomiyt) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Konomi_Kohara) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8E%9F%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E) | [TikTok](https://www.tiktok.com/@koharakonomiyt) She is a voice actress affiliated with Office Osawa. **Non-anime roles:** - [Mona](https://anilist.co/character/209678/Megistus-Mona) - Genshin Impact (VG) - [Arona](https://anilist.co/character/302229/Arona) - Blue Archive (VG) - Soda - Goddess of Victory: Nikke (VG) - Roccia - Wuthering Waves (VG) - Nobeta - Little Witch Nobeta (VG) - Chiz - Neverness to Everness (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n121961-TaMewK1taQm6.png'),(1501,'Miyu Tomita','[Profile](http://artist.amuse.co.jp/artist/tomita_miyu/) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/miyu-tomita/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/miyju_tomita) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/tomita__miyu._/) The Grand Prix winner of the 2014 Seiyuu Artist Training Program Selection competition, which was sponsored by Amuse and Ken Production. After being scouted by six talent agencies, she eventually joined Amuse. She made her voice acting debut in 2015, voicing a number of unnamed characters in Himouto Umaru-chan. Non-Anime Roles • Layla - Genshin Impact (VG) • Zara - Memento Mori (VG) • New Jersey - Azur Lane (VG) • Jiu Niangzi - Reverse: 1999 (VG) • Shimiko - Blue Archive (VG) • Youhu - Wuthering Waves (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119518-vZN7TPy12iuu.png'),(1502,'Ryouta Suzuki','[Profile (DASH ON)](https://dash-on.co.jp/talent/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/ryt_suzuki) **Non-Anime Roles:**','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n123450-Hmi5iu3KDHwc.png'),(1503,'Yumiri Hanamori','[Profile (tomorrow jam)](https://tomorrowjam.jp/talent/hanamori-yumiri/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/hanayumi09) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yumiri_Hanamori) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/花守ゆみり) **Non anime roles:** - Mercedes von Martritz - Fire Emblem Three Houses (Video Game) - NEKO#ΦωΦ - Muse Dash (Video Game) - Yanfei - Genshin Impact (Video Game) - Delta - Goddess of Victory: Nikke (Video Game) - Lantern - Honkai Impact 3rd (Video Game)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n116543-ugu1HZWiQkqi.jpg'),(1504,'Yutaka Aoyama',NULL,'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n96538-mM7J8gp87gut.jpg'),(1505,'Sayumi Suzushiro','[Profile (Arts Vision)](https://www.artsvision.co.jp/talent/14408/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/s_suzushiro) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/s_suzushiro/) **Non-Anime Roles:**','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n126963-GnhNcLWFeKmy.png'),(1506,'Shinichi Omata','Shinichi Omata is a Japanese director, storyboard artist, and former producer best known for directing Showa Genroku Rakugo Shinju (2016) and Kaguya-sama: Love is War (2019).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n111583-ngBEfLM6gtbN.jpg'),(1507,'Takeo Ootsuka','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/TakeoooOtsuka) | [Profile](https://www.imenterprise.jp/profile.php?id=28) In May 31st, 2024 he announced that he got married to a woman from outside the anime industry.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n128426-uB8KFqVLbogF.png'),(1508,'Asami Seto','[Profile (StarCrew)](https://www.starcrew.co.jp/talent/setoasami/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/SETO_A_OFFICIAL) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/seto_asami) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/seto-asami) | [YouTube](https://youtube.com/@Seto-Asami) A Japanese voice actress. Her debut role was Yoshino Takatsuki in Hourou Musuko. She likes to draw, and she became addicted to karuta while dubbing [Chihayafuru](https://anilist.co/anime/10800).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n106787-ojpoY7XEGYgc.jpg'),(1509,'Katsuyuki Konishi','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/i/user/121071138) | [Agency Profile](https://www.kenproduction.co.jp/talent/32) - Altair Ibn La Ahad - Assassin\'s Creed (VG) - Gosei Knight - Tensou Sentai Goseiger (Tokusatsu) - Sakuya - Otori Rewrite (VG) - Altair Ibn La Ahad - Assassin\'s Creed Reve