unit called AMADEUS under the name \"Jack Westwood\". On September 5, 2022, it was announced that he married the filmmaker and director Misato Kato.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119185-65kkxuTRxAgo.png'),(1515,'Kenshou Ono','[Profile (Animo Produce)](https://animoproduce.co.jp/artists/onokensho/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/ono_kensho) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/kenshoono1005/) Formerly married to voice actress [Kana Hanazawa](https://anilist.co/staff/95185/). **Non anime roles:** - Harry Potter - *Harry Potter* franchise (Live action films; JP dub) - [Diluc Ragnvindr](https://anilist.co/character/187554/) - *Genshin Impact* (Video Game) - Enforcer - *Arknights* (Mobile Game) - Miles Morales - *Spider-Man: Into The Spider Verse; Spider-Man: Across the Spider-Verse* (Films; JP dub) - Strohl - Metaphor: ReFantazio (Video Game)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95819-O4fosAY0a1Ml.jpg'),(1516,'Akio Ootsuka','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/AkioOtsuka) | [Profile (Mausu)](https://mausu.net/talent/otsuka-akio.html) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/大塚明夫) Son of voice actor [Chikao Ootsuka](https://anilist.co/staff/95974/). In 2005, he married fellow voice actress [Youko Soumi](https://anilist.co/staff/95912/), but they divorced in 2009. - [Heismay Noctule](https://anilist.co/character/355708/Heismay-Noctule) - Metaphor: ReFantazio (VG) - Koichi Adachi - Yakuza: Like a Dragon (VG) - [Ryouma Hoshi](https://anilist.co/character/131655/Ryouma-Hoshi) - Danganronpa V3 (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95146-T6IEmqXW3xUN.jpg'),(1517,'Mayumi Saco','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/_sacomayumi_) The official Japanese dub voice of Scarlett Johansson, Margot Robbie, Jessica Chastain, and Rachel McAdams.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/1673.jpg'),(1518,'Fuminori Komatsu',NULL,'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/12524.jpg'),(1519,'Hideaki Tezuka',NULL,'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n105185-JPuDW9dX28ed.png'),(1520,'Shuuhei Yabuta','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/i/user/1848968246) Formerly from Madbox, currently employed at [MAPPA](https://anilist.co/studio/569/). Additionally, he serves as a board member at [MAPPA](https://anilist.co/studio/569/).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n120824-TzMTviKnvxaV.png'),(1521,'Nozomu Sasaki','**Height:** 160cm [Website](https://nozomusasaki.com/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/nozomu_s_staff) On March 28, 2020, he announced that he had graduated from the Faculty of Law at the University of Tokyo, while working as a seiyuu.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95286-1RlrFeFKx3jn.png'),(1522,'Mamiko Noto','[Profile](https://osawa-inc.co.jp/women/notomamiko/) A Japanese actress, voice actress, and singer. She is married and has one kid. **Non-Anime Roles:**','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95040-hSONMMOAmiJ6.jpg'),(1523,'Tsutomu Isobe',NULL,'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95450-rw0UlIXU7keU.jpg'),(1524,'Mami Koyama','**Height:** 155 cm','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95571-QuL7zlRwRcxa.png'),(1525,'Hideyuki Tanaka','[Official Profile](https://www.aoni.co.jp/search/tanaka-hideyuki.html)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95234-YAu7XmoSIIS7.png'),(1526,'Junko Takeuchi','[Profile (BQMAP)](http://www.bqmap.com/prof/profile_takeuchi.html) | [Profile (Ogipro)](https://www.oginext.com/women/takeuchi.html) | [Blog](http://ameblo.jp/takeuchi-junko/) | [Twitter](http://www.twitter.com/junkotakeuchi45) Married to voice actor [Kenji Hamada](https://anilist.co/staff/95371/Kenji-Hamada) since 2006 and has two children.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95015-QwI9K4FRe4Cq.png'),(1527,'Nobuyuki Katsube',NULL,'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/1672.jpg'),(1528,'Masayuki Kojima','[Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/小島正幸) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masayuki_Kojima) Originating from Kaname Production, currently affiliated with [Kinema Citrus](https://anilist.co/studio/290/). Known for directing shows such as [Monster](https://anilist.co/anime/19/), [Made in Abyss](https://anilist.co/anime/97986/) and [Hanada Shounen-shi](https://anilist.co/anime/2004/).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n106507-60DlYq1pLslO.png'),(1529,'Mai Nakahara','[Profile](http://www.imenterprise.jp/profile.php?id=68) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/mai__nakahara) | [Wiki](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mai_Nakahara) A voice actress and singer. **Non-Anime Roles:** - Seele Vollerei - Honkai Impact 3rd, Honkai: Star Rail (VG) - Kaavi - Mahjong Soul (VG) - Hiyori Tsuchinaga - Blue Archive (VG) - Cantarella - Wuthering Waves (VG) - Mana - Goddess of Victory: Nikke (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95031-ochR43o7TrWs.jpg'),(1530,'Satomi Koorogi','**Non anime roles:** - Pichu and Togepi - Super Smash Bros. (Video Game) - May - Guilty Gear (Video Game)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95470-xZYG14WGMlmS.png'),(1531,'Ai Nonaka','__[Twitter](https://x.com/rarirurestn)__ |__ [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/ai_nonaka/)__ | __[Aoni Profile](http://www.aoni.co.jp/actress/na/nonaka-ai.html)__ Non-anime roles: - Honoka - Azur Lane (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95032-P8Hvtz5iaaoI.png'),(1532,'Houko Kuwashima','[Website](https://roudokuya.bitfan.id/) | [Profile](https://www.aoni.co.jp/search/kuwashima-houko.html) | [Twitter](https://x.com/roudokuya_dajai) Houko Kuwashima is a Japanese voice actress and singer. She is capable of playing a variety of roles, ranging from young boys to feminine women. Kuwashima is currently affiliated with Aoni Production. Her first major role was as Yurika Misumaru in Martian Successor Nadesico.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95057-zkd7yTPVxfyu.jpg'),(1533,'Ryou Hirohashi','A Japanese voice actor. She\'s also a certified junior and senior high school teacher. Hirohashi was born in Niigata Prefecture, and her family\'s home was a Buddhist temple. Because of this, she attended Ryukoku University in Kyoto, a Buddhist university. In the middle of her first year, however, her parents told her that she could do what she liked, even if it wasn\'t related to Buddhism, so she sought out what she wanted to do. During her second year, she remembered a radio show she used to listen to in middle school and became interested in voice acting, so she started going to the Aoni Coaching School Osaka while attending university at the same time. The radio personality she had listened to in junior high school was a voice actor, which inspired her to become a voice actor herself.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/95111-iw76EbsupYkS.jpg'),(1534,'Atsuko Enomoto','[Blog](https://lineblog.me/enomoto/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/atsuko_bewe) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/atsuko_bewe/) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMq89OLurLZSDqI7Agulozw) | [TikTok](https://www.tiktok.com/@atsuko_bewe)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95411-yVQiIcuYzQXr.jpg'),(1535,'Tatsuya Ishihara','A prominent director and a key member of [Kyoto Animation](https://anilist.co/studio/2/). After graduating from Osaka Designers\' College in the late \'80s, Ishihara joined Kyoto Animation and began his career as an animator. In 1991, he made his debut as a director with [Shiawasette Naani](https://anilist.co/anime/13441/). After that, he switched his focus to directing. Back then Kyoto Animation was still a sub-contracting studio, so therefore Ishihara could only get a handful of opportunities directing. Some of the shows in which Ishihara got to direct multiple episodes were [Tenchi Muyou!](https://anilist.co/anime/696/), [Aka-chan to Boku](https://anilist.co/anime/1485/), [Hyper Police](https://anilist.co/anime/1180/), and [Inuyasha](https://anilist.co/anime/249/).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n100055-nZQ0hBIYNwW0.png'),(1536,'Megumi Toyoguchi','[Profile](https://www.81produce.co.jp/actor_search/index.php/item?id=252) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/tokyojyanken/) - Nicole Reeyn - Genshin Impact (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95144-9Y8CtDVmxogE.jpg'),(1537,'Mayumi Tanaka','[Profile](https://www.aoni.co.jp/search/tanaka-mayumi.html) A Japanese actress, voice actress, and narrator. She received the Kazue Takahashi Award at the 5th Seiyu Awards.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95075-1qD4TeW1ON92.png'),(1538,'Hiroaki Hirata','[Website](http://www.hiratahiroaki.com/)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95125-NeFFiJupoDVj.png'),(1539,'Yuriko Yamaguchi','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/yurituki1121) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/yurituki11/) **Non anime roles:** Rhinedottir - Genshin Impact (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95130-GoO41ve3YWQw.png'),(1540,'Akemi Okamura',NULL,'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95076-itRGy8F3x5Em.png'),(1541,'Ikue Ootani','[Profile (mausu)](https://mausu.net/talent/otani-ikue.html)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95128-9YWpE1d2U8Sj.png'),(1542,'Kappei Yamaguchi','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/i/user/267684720) Affiliated with Gokū and 21st Century Fox. Best known for the roles of Ranma Saotome (Ranma ½), Tombo (Kiki\'s Delivery Service), Yattaro (Kyattou Ninden Teyandee), InuYasha (InuYasha), L (Death Note), Usopp (One Piece), Hideyoshi (Law of Ueki), and Kaito Kid and Shinichi Kudo (Detective Conan). He made his first public appearance in North America at Otakon 2008. Father of [Ryuunosuke](https://anilist.co/staff/278275/) and [Akane Yamaguchi](https://anilist.co/staff/210640/).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95067-hqIpNxMfAuN2.png'),(1543,'Choo','Shigeru Nagashima, known professionally as Choo, is a Japanese actor, voice actor and narrator. His former stage name was Yuuichi Nagashima, he changed his stage name to Choo on August 23rd, 2006. He is a graduate of the Nishogakusha University Department of Literature and received training at Bungakuza\'s research establishment and the Seinenza Theater Company before attaching himself to Production Baobab in 1986. He transferred to the Tokyo Actor\'s Consumer\'s Cooperative Society in 2007. Choo\'s hobbies include badminton and jogging, and he is a licensed calligraphy instructor.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95898-XHSESV65G8Jv.png'),(1544,'Kishou Taniyama','[Profile](http://www.kenproduction.co.jp/talent/member.php?mem=m33) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/kishownstarmaps) He is also the vocalist and lyricist of the Japanese rock band [GRANRODEO](https://anilist.co/staff/103917/). **Non anime roles:** - [Panpanman](https://anilist.co/character/344471/PanPanMan) - YanOta: The Delinquent and the Otaku (Drama CD)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95196-t2vbxQMee0ci.png'),(1545,'Kanae Itou','[Profile (Aoni)](https://www.aoni.co.jp/search/ito-kanae.html) | [Profile (Lantis)](https://www.lantis.jp/artist/itokanae/) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/kanae_1126_ito) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/itokanae_info) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/ito-kanae/) After graduating from high school, Kanae enrolled at the Amusement Media Academy, a vocational school for voice actors and artists, and graduated in 2007. Prior to graduating she was a member of two voice acting groups called Koetchi (こえっち) and Rirachitchi (りらちっち) before both groups disbanded in December 2005 and January 28, 2007 respectively. Her first major role came in 2007 when she played the lead heroine, Amu Hinamori, from the anime Shugo Chara!. The show became a hit and Kanae was praised by critics.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95762-qhWmwni3TT6Y.png'),(1546,'Tomoya Kitagawa',NULL,NULL),(1547,'Setsuo Itou','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/setsuo_itou) | [Profile](http://www.air-agency.co.jp/talent/man/setsuo_ito)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119798-MB7zfSYLR5ZM.jpg'),(1548,'Yuzuru Tachikawa','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/usagi_rakuda) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/立川譲) After graduating from university in 2007, Tachikawa joined [Madhouse](https://anilist.co/studio/11/) where he debuted as an episode director on [Kiba](https://anilist.co/anime/845/)\'s final episode. After this he went freelance. Some years later in 2013, Tachikawa created, wrote and directed [Death Billiards](https://anilist.co/anime/14353/), a short film produced by Madhouse as part of Young Animator Training Project\'s; Anime Mirai, a project which funds young creators and animators. Two years later, Tachikawa got to turn the idea into a 12-episode TV series titled [Death Parade](https://anilist.co/anime/20931/).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n113371-LztTCTu2WKhx.png'),(1549,'Naoya Uchida','__[Profile](https://osawa-inc.co.jp/men/uchidanaoya/) | [Blog](http://office-nao.sblo.jp/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/Nao1953Naoya)__ Naoya Uchida is a Japanese voice actor, actor, and singer. He has played several minor roles of authority in various television dramas. He debuted in 1972 in the NHK program Maboroshi no Satsui and continued acting in theater and television dramas until the late 1990s. Since then, he has refocused his career on vocal performances such as opera and dubbing. He is best known for his role as Madara Uchiha in Naruto, and coincidentally his last name is similar to the character\'s. **Non anime roles:** - Tatsuya Midorikawa (DenziGreen) - Denshi Sentai Denziman (TV Series) - Philip Martin - Reverse Collapse: Code Name Bakery (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95338-hoqbedi0LHZf.png'),(1550,'Kenichirou Matsuda','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/mochimochinomen) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/松田健一郎) Affiliated with Arts Vision.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n105273-asextl049B2s.png'),(1551,'Hitomi Nabatame','**Height:**163cm [Profile (Ken Production)](https://www.kenproduction.co.jp/talent/66) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/nabatamehitomi/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/_nabacan_) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/naba3po/) She was part of the seiyuu unit with [Shizuka Itou](https://anilist.co/staff/95093/) called \"Hitomi Nabatame to Shizuka Itou\" (生天目仁美と伊藤静) under Geneon\'s cosmic★motion label. Together they are known by the name Hitoshizuku (ひとしずく).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95184-OpXCWNXhJJpg.png'),(1552,'Tomoyo Kurosawa','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/TomoyoKurosawa) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/tomoyo_kurosawa_official_/) | [Blog](http://ameblo.jp/kurosawa-tomoyo/) A Japanese actress, voice actress, and singer. Kurosawa began studying acting at the age of 3. In 2000, she began appearing in TV dramas, commercials and stage performances. At the age of 13, she made her voice acting debut as [Natsuki Koyama](https://anilist.co/character/30214/) in the 2010 anime film [Welcome to the Space Show](https://anilist.co/anime/8115/). Kurosawa became a support member of Sound Horizon in 2008. On June 8, 2023, her agency announced her marriage on Twitter.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n106661-xn3K6nAx2ijO.jpg'),(1553,'Chika Anzai','[Profile](https://avex-pictures.co.jp/lineup/91485/) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/chikachika_anzai_official/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/Anchika_manager) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdWglOsvq7Q_3-XM5XMxaqQ) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/chika-anzai/) She moved to Tokyo at 15 to pursue a voice acting career. She is a voice actress affiliated with Avex Entertainment. She was training at Maho Academy previously. She\'s a cousin of [Junya Enoki](https://anilist.co/staff/119319). Won a Best Lead Actor award at the 17th Annual Seiyu Awards (2023).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n106030-oz4RUJZ3D9v9.png'),(1554,'Ayaka Asai','[Profile](https://intention-k.com/profile/ayaka_asai) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/ayakasai0511) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/lucky-girl1010/) Cindy Chandra in \"Suke Jan Deka\" (VG) (Japanese) Daisy in \"Granado Espada\" (MMORPG) (Japanese) Mirei Hayasaka in \"Idolmaster Cinderella Girls: Starlight Stage\" (VG/Idol) (Japanese) Lucy in Zenless Zone Zero (VG) (Japanese)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n118939-6W4V2P4JL6QH.png'),(1555,'Moe Toyota','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/toyotamoe) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/toyotamoe/) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/toyotamoe/) | [Agency Profile](http://stylecube.jp/talents/moe/index.html) She is one of the new members of [StylipS](https://anilist.co/staff/111177) that joined on April 27, 2013 and is one half of its subunit, [Pyxis](https://anilist.co/staff/139753), along with [Miku Itou](https://anilist.co/staff/118581/Miku-Itou).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n118398-zJucBJqURpw2.png'),(1556,'Haruki Ishiya','**Height:** 171 cm [Twitter](https://twitter.com/haruki_yokkora)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119200-guyDteKAqtuo.png'),(1557,'Shiori Sugiura','[Profile (I\'m Enterprise)](https://www.imenterprise.jp/profile.php?id=39) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/shioririri_)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119870-HDgOuMkrhNUP.png'),(1558,'Jun Fukuyama','[Profile (Pony Canyon)](https://www.ponycanyon.co.jp/artist/31356600) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/black_fukuyama) Fukuyama released his debut music album \"Romantic World 31\" on his birthday (November 26) in 2009, his second album \"Love Letters 2: Paris Romantic\" on July 21, 2010, his third album \"Fukuyama Jun, Ai wo Utau!\" on May 25, 2011, and his fourth album \"Love Letter 3 ~Matsuri no Kuni de~\" on May 22, 2013. He also appeared in a 2009 romantic comedy movie Fujoshi Kanojo in a cameo role.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95086-cwKYmhOFNtH5.png'),(1559,'Yukana','**Height:** 160 cm [Website](https://www.yukana.com/) | [Profile (Sigma7)](https://sigma7.co.jp/actors/yukana) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/from_yukana) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCAt2ejts-_kslH4B0wAVRgQ) **Non-Anime Roles:**','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95140-sFp0uedEmZ9f.png'),(1560,'Ami Koshimizu','[Profile](https://endless-glory.com/talent_ak/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/AMISUKESHIGOM)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95070-klkIfKz1VItS.png'),(1561,'Junko Minagawa','[Agency Profile](https://haikyo.co.jp/profile/profile.php?ActorID=11724)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95062-YMTfpO89SgQp.jpg'),(1562,'Kaori Nazuka','__[Blog](http://blog.excite.co.jp/kamosan) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/nazukakaori) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/nazuka_kaori424/)__ **Non-anime roles:** • Robin - Honkai: Star Rail (VG) • Tsukishiro Yanagi - Zenless Zone Zero (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95078-tMm7zdlRNZ3P.jpg'),(1563,'Yoshiyuki Kouno','[Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/幸野善之)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95799-abUzVUm0gMka.png'),(1564,'Ken Narita','Ken Narita is a Japanese actor, voice actor and narrator. His real name is Tsutomu Narita. He is currently a freelancer.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95109-iOWKX2uxDWnj.png'),(1565,'Gorou Taniguchi','Among [Sunrise](https://anilist.co/studio/14/)\'s most noted directors. Famous directorial works include [Planetes](https://anilist.co/anime/329/), [Scryed](https://anilist.co/anime/168/), [Infinite Ryvius](https://anilist.co/anime/593/) as well as [Code Geass](https://anilist.co/anime/1575/), which is an original story created by him and the series\' lead writer [Ichirou Ookouchi](https://anilist.co/staff/98067/). Taniguchi is the one who proposed the idea to the producers at Sunrise. The basic idea for the plot consisted of a \"hero\" who led a secret organization, which was later developed into a conflict between two characters with different values and who belonged to the same military unit.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n98066-bTTfUD2v3dVh.png'),(1566,'Daiki Yamashita','[Profile (Arts Vision)](https://www.artsvision.co.jp/talent/518/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/DaiKing_boy) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/daiki_yamashita_boy/) | [Website](https://yamashitadaiki.com/) He is affiliated with Arts Vision and was the winner of the Best Male Newcomer award at the 8th Seiyu Awards in 2014.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n116971-KDHjlYPO4HrS.png'),(1567,'Kouki Uchiyama','[Profile](https://profile.himawari.net/view/1559) Koki Uchiyama is a Japanese actor and voice actor from Saitama Prefecture affiliated with Himawari Theatre Group.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n96764-yJWGrhjanDJQ.png'),(1568,'Kenta Miyake','[Blog](http://gree.jp/miyake_kenta/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/miyake_ktrm) **Non-Anime Roles:**','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95720-enxx6kZKuwGi.jpg'),(1569,'Souichirou Hoshi',NULL,'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95030-kj64Uy6Zr3bq.png'),(1570,'Kousuke Kuwano','[Profile (Mitt Management)](https://mittma.com/profile/kosuke_kuwano/) | [Twitter](https://x.com/kosukekuwano) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/kuwano.ko_stagram/)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n120115-t5mbtHRNUzeT.png'),(1571,'Kenji Nagasaki','Originating from [Madhouse](https://anilist.co/studio/11/). Aspired to work in the industry after having seen [Laputa: Castle in the Sky](https://anilist.co/anime/513/).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n108677-jL6WHUX83Dr8.png'),(1572,'Naomi Nakayama','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/mogu703) Originating from [Madhouse](https://anilist.co/studio/11/).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n144207-Hp8bHZDftyhw.png'),(1573,'Takanori Hoshino','**Height:** 190 cm','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/1052.jpg'),(1574,'Yuu Shimamura','[Agency Profile (Ken Production)](https://www.kenproduction.co.jp/talent/262) | [Blog](http://yaplog.jp/cygx-1/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/shimayulondon) - Jane Doe - Zenless Zone Zero (VG) - Little Mermaid (Siren) - Goddess of Victory: NIKKE (VG) - Chise Waraku - Blue Archive (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n100295-SLfRq3RqJEoF.jpg'),(1575,'Takahiro Hasui','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/i/user/1014039670085201920)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n138094-1i64vsDxpAho.png'),(1576,'Ayumu Murase','**Height:** 172cm [Website](https://muraseayumu.com/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/murase_pipipi) In 2016, he won Best Male Rookie at the 10th Seiyu Awards. On May 1, 2023, he announced that he was leaving his previous talent agency VIMS to start his own, Aster Nine. **Non anime roles:** - [Venti](https://anilist.co/character/187525/) - Genshin Impact (Video game) - Istaroth - Genshin Impact (Video game) - [Mizuki](https://anilist.co/character/292633/) - Arknights (Video game) - Don Murasame - Avataro Sentai Donbrothers (Tokusatsu series)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n110919-zz5dq39kyzNC.png'),(1577,'Ryouhei Kimura','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/Ryouhey_Drunk) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCP-evNobN1MJ61xHb8tAhcg) Won Best Supporting Actor at the 6th Annual Seiyuu Awards for his performance as Kodaka Hasegawa in _Boku wa Tomodachi ga Sukunai_. Also part of the trio Trignal with fellow seiyuu [Takuya Eguchi](https://anilist.co/staff/102695/Eguchi-Takuya) and [Tsubasa Yonaga](https://anilist.co/staff/95556), and a host of the Kiramune label\'s radio programs. - [Childe](https://anilist.co/character/209687/Tartaglia) - Genshin Impact (VG) - [Kaito Momota](https://anilist.co/character/126284/Kaito-Momota) - Danganronpa V3 (VG) - Hyde Kido - Under Night In-Birth (VG) - Touri Wataru - Hanaemu Kare to & bloom (VN)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n96762-DNKMFBA2vWRr.jpg'),(1578,'Susumu Mitsunaka','[Twitter](http://twitter.com/i/user/336690901) Originating from [Doga Kobo](https://anilist.co/studio/95/).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n113823-glvO3e0Y7vcL.png'),(1579,'Fuuko Mori','[Profile (KeKKe)](https://www.kekke.co.jp/talent/female/hw/mori.html) | [Twitter](https://x.com/mori_fuko)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n347891-0l8jmdz2MO69.jpg'),(1580,'Junichi Suwabe','[Profile](https://haikyo.co.jp/profile/profile.php?ActorID=11470) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/zenraojisan/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/MY_MURMUR) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/j.suwabe/) Won Best Song at the 6th Seiyuu Awards (2012) for \"ST☆RISH\" (shared with Takuma Terashima, Kenichi Suzumura, Kishou Taniyama, Mamoru Miyano, Hiro Shimono) in _Uta no☆Prince-sama♪ Maji Love 1000%_. Won Best Supporting Actor at the 7th Seiyuu Awards (2013). **Non-Anime Roles:** - Radio DJ - Kamen Rider Kuuga (TV Series) - Artem Wing - Tears of Themis (VG) - Jenua - Epic Seven (VG) - Dekotorade - Bakuage Sentai Boonboomger (TV Series) - McBurn - The Legend of Heroes Series (VG) - Kai - Rune Factory: Guardians of Azuma (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95095-DvSjTQnqcgXP.png'),(1581,'Sumire Morohoshi','[Profile](https://profile.himawari.net/view/1622) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/smileysuu) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/sumire&#95;&#95;morohoshi/) | [YouTube](https://youtube.com/channel/UCTlieWyDS62ZGG3yMFswS5g) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sumire_Morohoshi) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%AB%B8%E6%98%9F%E3%81%99%E3%81%BF%E3%82%8C) Sumire Morohoshi is a Japanese actress, voice actress and singer from Kanagawa Prefecture. She is affiliated with Himawari Theatre Group, and debuted as a solo singer under the record label Flying Dog.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n106404-uodatsBbsnJh.png'),(1582,'Eriko Matsui','**Height:** 160cm [Twitter](https://twitter.com/erikomatsui) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/lenp/)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n115835-3uhE3pEKEsEN.png'),(1583,'Takashi Kondou','[Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/近藤隆) **Non-Anime Roles:** - Ororon - Genshin Impact (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95206-R0eBPiYR9CRD.jpg'),(1584,'Mie Sonozaki','[Official Website](https://www.sonozaki-mie.com/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/sonozaki_mie) Sonozaki went under a hiragana writing of her name as a stage name before she became a regular in TV series and drama outside of anime, whereupon she switched to using her real name.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95602-kU7d6TvluxWB.jpg'),(1585,'Sayaka Oohara','[Profile](https://haikyo.co.jp/profile/profile.php?ActorID=11570) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/readingradio) Her younger brother [Takashi Oohara](https://anilist.co/staff/96636/) is also a voice actor. - Harran - Goddess of Victory - Nikke (VG) - Ningguang - Genshin Impact (VG) - Mikasa - Azur Lane (VG) - Sunbringer - Zenless Zone Zero (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95092-dQXsTFQXLg3o.png'),(1586,'Miyuki Ooshiro',NULL,NULL),(1587,'Yuuichirou Hayashi','He started his career at Studio Live working on outsourced episodes for a few years. His first major role was as mechanical designer on the short series [The Cosmopolitan Prayers](https://anilist.co/anime/112/). After leaving Studio Live he was involved in several [Studio 4°C](https://anilist.co/studio/13/) and [MADHOUSE](https://anilist.co/studio/11/) projects, with the former studio housing his debut as director on the short TOYOTA commercial series [PES: Peace Eco Smiles](https://anilist.co/anime/13427/). He\'s been affiliated with Studio [MAPPA](https://anilist.co/studio/569/) since 2014 where he helmed his first TV Series, [Garo: The Animation](https://anilist.co/anime/20753/), and several other anime.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n115016-htRke6jznhfn.jpg'),(1588,'Haruka Fukuhara','__[Website](https://fukuharaharuka-music.com/) | [Actress Profile (Ken-on)](https://www.ken-on.co.jp/haruka/) | [Artist Profile (Ken-on)](https://www.ken-on.co.jp/artists/fukuhara-voice-actor/) | [Blog (JP)](https://ameblo.jp/roomharuka) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/haruka_staff) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/haruka.f.official/) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0aQ827BDrHcDSNaM1_qaxA)__ __Haruka Fukuhara__ is a Japanese voice actress, artist, vocalist and model. On October 2, 2026, she announced her marriage to Japanese footballer Takefusa Kubo.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n102322-GkjxD99Pt3rT.png'),(1589,'Kouhei Kiyasu','**Graduated:** Hiroshima University **Major:** Art __Kouhei Kiyasu__ is a Japanese voice actor, seiyuu and singer, who also does script/screenwriting and series composition for anime. He is a member of the theater troupe [Nylon 100℃](http://www.sillywalk.com/nylon/) alongside Inuyama Inuko, Ookura Kouji and Shintani Mayumi. He is also the chairman of his own troupe called _Bull Docking Headlock_ (ブルドッキングヘッドロック).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/619.jpg'),(1590,'Megumi Tano','[Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/田野めぐみ)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n105368-Mua8sH2sF9Jj.png'),(1591,'Kenji Utsumi','Kenji Utsumi was a Japanese actor and voice actor affiliated with the self-founded Ken Production. He was married to fellow voice actress [Michiko Nomura](https://anilist.co/staff/101463/) until his death. He was best known for his roles such as [Alex Louis Armstrong](https://anilist.co/character/2079/) in [Fullmetal Alchemist](https://anilist.co/anime/121/), [Genji Kamogawa](https://anilist.co/character/10156/) in [Hajime no Ippo](https://anilist.co/anime/263/), [Raoh](https://anilist.co/character/8738/) in [Fist of the North Star](https://anilist.co/anime/967/). He received a lifetime achievement award at the third Seiyu Awards. He passed away from peritoneal cancer on June 13, 2013.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95138-0iK7jnkuJb6o.png'),(1592,'Masaya Onosaka','A Japanese voice actor. He is known for his Kansai accent in some roles. In 2010, he won the Seiyuu Award for Best Personality. Has a [YouTube channel](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJQb0Pou939pDubqrvTSRSA/) where he plays video games and phone apps with [Katsuyuki Konishi](https://anilist.co/staff/95020/).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95173-LIuN04REF5eA.png'),(1593,'Toshiyuki Morikawa','[Profile](http://www.axl-one.com/talent/morikawa.html) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/toshiyukimorikawa/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/moriax291) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/森川智之) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toshiyuki_Morikawa) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/moriax291/) - William - Reverse Collapse: Code Name Bakery (VG) - Calcharo - Wuthering Waves (VG) - Severian Lowell - Zenless Zone Zero (VG) - Leon S. Kennedy - Resident Evil 4 Remake (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95006-hoLuiZANeD3Q.png'),(1594,'Satoshi Nishimura','Originating from Studio Live. Started off as an animator before transitioning to doing directing and storyboarding. *(Not to be confused with the younger animator with the same name [Satoshi Nishimura](https://anilist.co/staff/380827))*','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n105285-JDe0Ndf0YPlj.jpg'),(1595,'Shouya Chiba','[Profile](https://www.toysfactory.co.jp/artist/shoyachiba) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/shoya_chiba) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/shoya_chiba_official/) - Sethos - Genshin Impact (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119672-2CrLoxBEYTMk.jpg'),(1596,'Seiichirou Yamashita','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/seichiro0521) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8B%E8%AA%A0%E4%B8%80%E9%83%8E) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seiichir%C5%8D_Yamashita) Seiichirou Yamashita is a voice actor affiliated with Office Osawa.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n118249-aws1DsuN7cUW.png'),(1597,'Natsumi Fujiwara','[Profile (Arts Vision)](https://www.artsvision.co.jp/talent/3817/) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%97%A4%E5%8E%9F%E5%A4%8F%E6%B5%B7) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Natsumi_Fujiwara) Natsumi Fujiwara is a Japanese voice actress affiliated with Arts Vision. **Non-Anime Roles:**','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119740-EEZ5DErQhOht.png'),(1598,'Ikumi Hasegawa','[Agency Profile](https://www.raccoon-dog.co.jp/talent/r11-hasegawa.html)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n132768-r4FwpBpHnRtZ.png'),(1599,'Riho Sugiyama','[Profile](https://mausu.net/talent/sugiyama-riho.html) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/sugiyama_riho) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%89%E5%B1%B1%E9%87%8C%E7%A9%82) She is a voice actress affiliated with Mausu Production.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n125475-0CWs2AKNtmfk.png'),(1600,'Toshimasa Ishii','Though he was a Physics major at Chiba University, he joined an Anime Research Club that inspired him to enter the industry. He started as a Production Assistant affiliated with [A-1 Pictures](https://anilist.co/studio/561/A1-Pictures) and gradually moved to directorial roles.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n136625-JXllyn7pgrA7.png'),(1601,'Yoshino Aoyama','[Profile (81produce)](https://www.81produce.co.jp/dcms_plusdb/index.php/item?cell003=%E3%81%82%E8%A1%8C&cell029=%E5%A5%B3%E6%80%A7&keyword=&cell028=&cell004=&name=%E9%9D%92%E5%B1%B1%E3%80%80%E5%90%89%E8%83%BD&id=146&label=1) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/yopipi555) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/yopipinsta555/) | [Spotify](https://open.spotify.com/artist/2oWuPhnuBys0IELQq85Ww2) | [Apple Music](https://music.apple.com/artist/aoyama-yoshino/1122368744) | [Deezer](https://deezer.page.link/5mii1BmZpaNTCA1KA) | [Youtube Music](https://music.youtube.com/channel/UCmFz2zC7wBI00bcyBGiwE-g)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n118475-19IqPJRpa08T.png'),(1602,'Saku Mizuno','**Height:** 156 cm [Profile (Haikyo)](https://haikyo.co.jp/profile/profile.php?ActorID=13181&ImageFile=3&VoiceFile=) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/mizuno_saku/) | [Threads](https://www.threads.com/@mizuno_saku) | [Twitch](https://www.twitch.tv/mizuno_saku) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/mizuno_saku) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/@mizuno_saku) **Non-Anime Roles:**','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n213951-EQGfRStCAJ2Q.jpg'),(1603,'Maaya Uchida','[Website](http://uchidamaaya.jp/) | [Profile](https://www.imenterprise.jp/profile.php?id=26) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/maaya_taso) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/uchidamaayataso/) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJFEXIRB6DP_2FQJzv7pbXg) Maaya Uchida is a Japanese actress, voice actress and singer who works for I\'m Enterprise. She is [Yuuma Uchida](https://anilist.co/staff/119617/)\'s older sister. Announced her marriage to fellow voice actor [Kaito Ishikawa](https://anilist.co/staff/115156/Kaito-Ishikawa) on September 30, 2025. **Awards:** - She won the Best New Actress Award at the 8th Seiyuu Awards, for her role as [Hajime Ichinose](https://anilist.co/character/85153/). **Non-Anime Roles:**','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n108639-LLrR4WptCh5s.png'),(1604,'Sayaka Senbongi','[Agency Profile](http://www.imenterprise.jp/profile.php?id=44) Married voice actor [Tasuku Hatanaka](https://anilist.co/staff/107018) in 2020.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119616-Dakq7gsUo2ja.png'),(1605,'Kotori Koiwai','[Profile (Peerless Gerbera)](http://pg-wcf.co.jp/profile/04/) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/koiwai-kotori/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/koiwai_kotori) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClDfVHJxrsGTq61MJp55s3Q) | [ASMR Website](https://www.kotoneiro.com/) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kotori_Koiwai) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/小岩井ことり) Kotori Koiwai is a Japanese voice actress, songwriter, and lyricist from Kyoto. She is affiliated with Peerless Gerbera. Koiwai is voice provider for both VOCALOIDs MEIKA Hime and Mikoto, who debuted in VOCALOID5.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n109131-SUCT2cc4jMvd.jpg'),(1606,'Misaki Watada','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/machauq) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/machauq/) | [Agency Profile](https://www.aoni.co.jp/search/watada-misaki.html)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n152199-VVKAzgSZLFqX.png'),(1607,'Gakuto Kajiwara','**Height:** 178 cm [Twitter](https://twitter.com/gaku_kajiwara) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/kajiwaragakuto_official/) | [Youtube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFmaSBbgN5IXqdyA5NeksuA) | [TikTok](https://www.tiktok.com/@kajiwaragakuto_official) Born in Osaka but spending much of his youth in Toyama, he went to high school in Singapore for a few years before moving to Tokyo. Alongside his seiyuu work, he also has a YouTube Channel. **Non-Anime Roles:** • Luka in \"Honkai: Star Rail\" (VG) (Japanese) • Hiiro Amagi in \"Ensemble Stars!!\" (VG) (Japanese)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n123286-TfHayiK4hqbk.png'),(1608,'Kana Yuuki','[Profile](https://vims.co.jp/talent_profile_detail.php?id=32) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/yuukikana_0u0) She is a voice actress affiliated with VIMS.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n118739-hIVuGI5fgL5e.png'),(1609,'Tatsuhisa Suzuki','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/ta2hisa_suzuki) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/ta2hisa_suzuki/) Tatsuhisa is a Japanese voice actor and singer, and he is affiliated with I\'m Enterprise and Lantis. He is the vocalist of the rock band [OLDCODEX](https://anilist.co/staff/112151/OLDCODEX) under his stage name Ta_2, who also provides the opening/ending themes of many of the anime he stars in. He not only sings but also composes some of the songs. He also belongs to Style Five, in charge of the endings of Free! He also likes bicycling, karaoke, reading and video games. He is known for his numerous roles in anime series, his main breakout roles in the West were as Takao in Kuroko no Basuke and especially as Makoto Tachibana in Free!.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95735-xssSe5BRSkaq.jpg'),(1610,'Ayataka Tanemura',NULL,'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n142304-2TMyrjQs34Ma.jpg'),(1611,'Yuuto Nakano','**Height:** 174 cm [Agency Profile](http://gree.jp/nakano_yuto)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95216-WgWwifUs89xf.png'),(1612,'Shiori Koshikawa','[Wiki (JP)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B6%8A%E5%B7%9D%E8%A9%A9%E7%B9%94) Shiori Koshikawa is an actress and voice actress. Daughter of voice actress [Sumi Shimamoto](https://anilist.co/staff/95425).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n185752-9YrVN6JzAnSA.png'),(1613,'Rinna Ishikawa','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/happygirlrinna) Rinna Ishikawa is an actress affiliated with News Entertainment.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n185753-e6IHlShgtFDW.png'),(1614,'Toshio Furukawa','[Website](http://www.topio.jp/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/i/user/328915516) | [Agency Profile](https://www.aoni.co.jp/search/furukawa-toshio.html) Husband of voice actress [Shino Kakinuma](https://anilist.co/staff/96408).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95673-jNN4GqGgpssj.png'),(1615,'Kouji Tsujimoto','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/tsujimoto_kouji) | [Profile (FMG)](http://fmg.jp/profile/kouji_tsujimoto.html) | [Wiki (JP)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%BE%BB%E6%9C%AC%E8%80%95%E5%BF%97) Kouji Tsujimoto is a comedian, actor and voice actor.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n185755-vDLIfl0SS7eb.png'),(1616,'Rin Kanazawa','Rin Kanazawa is an actor affiliated with Gekidan Himawari.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n185751-oXRbIBh45jDS.png'),(1617,'Hiroshi Nagahama','[Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/長濱博史) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hiroshi_Nagahama)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n99346-iQV0Oh4lWo5K.png'),(1618,'Kouichi Yamadera','A Japanese actor, voice actor, singer and narrator from Shiogama, Miyagi Prefecture. He graduated from Tohoku Gakuin University\'s economics school and is currently affiliated with Across Entertainment. He was the manager of the Tagajou Senior High School basketball team before he made a name for himself. His voice acting debut was the OVA [Megazone 23](https://anilist.co/anime/1935/) as the motorcycle-riding [Shinji Nakagawa](https://anilist.co/character/56633/), while his television debut was the anime [Bosco Adventure](https://anilist.co/anime/3460/) as the cowardly Otter.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95011-2RfLzncNyvbR.png'),(1619,'Shigeru Ushiyama','Shigeru Ushiyama is a Japanese actor and seiyuu from Nagano Prefecture. He is affiliated with Gekidan Subaru and is married to fellow seiyuu Keiko Aizawa.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n102555-M2VcOd9jjdev.jpg'),(1620,'Yuuki Ono','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/onoyuki19840622) | [Official Website](http://www.onoyuki.com/) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/onoyuki_official/) Yuuki Ono is a Japanese voice actor and singer who dubs in anime shows and video games. He was represented by Atomic Monkey and is now a freelancer. His major roles are: Josuke Higashikata in JoJo\'s Bizarre Adventure: Diamond Is Unbreakable, Taiga Kagami in Kuroko\'s Basketball, Zenkichi Hitoyoshi in Medaka Box, Kaname Tsukahara in Kimi to Boku, Masayuki Hori in Monthly Girls\' Nozaki-kun and Ishisaki Jun in Ace of Diamond. On October 2, 2017, Ono announced his marriage from the last seven years prior in his blog post. His wife is a person who works outside the entertainment industry.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n96154-B8GAO9wm1Fbd.jpg'),(1621,'Toshihiko Seki','Holds a 2nd Dan rank in Kendo. A veteran Japanese voice actor who has played characters in anime, drama CDs and video games. Apart from voice work, Toshihiko Seki sometimes does live-action drama stage work and is a member of 81 Produce. • Dottore (Genshin Impact) • Chongyue (Arknights)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95129-AAL7kfwAPpgR.jpg'),(1622,'Junya Enoki','[Profile](http://www.atomicmonkey.jp/jp/archives/talent/enokijunya) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/enojunjunjun) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A6%8E%E6%9C%A8%E6%B7%B3%E5%BC%A5) Junya Enoki is a Japanese voice actor affiliated with Atomic Monkey. His hobbies are boxing and kendo. Enoki became interested in acting while in college after watching the anime Gurren Lagann. He\'s a cousin of [Chika Anzai](https://anilist.co/staff/106030). Caelus in \"Honkai: Star Rail\" (VG)!~','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119319-yIrrUOUaJuSm.png'),(1623,'Yuuma Uchida','[Website](https://www.uchidayuma.com/) | [Profile](https://intention-k.com/profile/yuma_uchida) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/yuma_u_official) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/i_am_yumauchida) A Japanese voice actor and singer. He made his singing debut in May 2018 under the King Records label. He is [Maaya Uchida](https://anilist.co/staff/108639/)\'s younger brother. His agency announced that he married the voice actress [Rina Hidaka](https://anilist.co/staff/100250) on January 1st, 2024. - In 2017, he won Best Male Newcomer at the 11th Seiyuu Awards for his role as [Hayate Immelmann](https://anilist.co/character/90102/). - In 2019, he won Best Male Lead Actor at the 13th Seiyuu Awards for his role as [Ash Lynx](https://anilist.co/character/13580/).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119617-icFDk96OdV5k.png'),(1624,'Aya Endou','[Profile](https://intention-k.com/profile/aya_endo) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/e_aya217/) On August 8, 2013, she reported her marriage on her blog. - Yelan - Genshin Impact (VG) - [Elie MacDowell](https://anilist.co/character/72233/) - The Legend of Heroes Series (VG) - [Aglaea](https://anilist.co/character/383384/) - Honkai: Star Rail (VG) - Astra Yao - Zenless Zone Zero (VG) - Flora - Goddess of Victory: Nikke (VG) - [Kiyomi](https://anilist.co/character/394159/) - BLUE DROP (Radio Drama)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95054-USmUajnl3bnT.jpg'),(1625,'Anna Nagase','[Profile](https://www.81produce.co.jp/actor_search/index.php/item?id=381) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/anna_nagase) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anna_Nagase) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B8%E7%80%AC%E3%82%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%83%8A) She studied rakugo in preparation for her role as [Akane](https://anilist.co/character/264023/Akane-Ousaki) in [Akane-banashi](https://anilist.co/anime/196935/Akanebanashi/). Won the Best New Actor Award at the 17th Seiyuu Awards in 2023. **Non-Anime Roles** - Chixia - Wuthering Waves (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n182100-drkeWjMKToYg.png'),(1626,'Shouta Goshozono','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/i/user/1782989852717539328) | [Sakugabooru](https://www.sakugabooru.com/post?tags=shota_goshozono) Originating from [Xebec Zwei](https://anilist.co/studio/898/Xebec-Zwei). Currently affiliated with [MAPPA](https://anilist.co/studio/569/MAPPA).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n131334-BEyZ3f1Erd1Y.png'),(1627,'Kenjirou Tsuda','[Website](https://tsudaken.jp/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/tsuda_ken) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/2_da_ken/) | [Youtube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_EGdEIJrwsOTxucjF3xU8Q) Kenjirou Tsuda is a Japanese actor, voice actor, and film director who grew up in Jakarta, Indonesia, where he lived until he was seven years old. He is married with a woman from outside the entertainment industry and has two children. His hobbies are taking pictures and biking; he likes 50mm single focus cameras and old motorcycles. Tsuda majored in theater studies in the department of literature at Meiji University.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95591-WQGdD3ubbeoq.jpg'),(1628,'Saya Hitomi','[Profile (Black Ship)](https://www.blackship.jp/female/sayahitomi/) | [Twitter](https://x.com/1103_saya_)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n330963-jY1jUdktAlvk.png'),(1629,'Miyuri Shimabukuro','[Agency (Osawa Inc)](https://osawa-inc.co.jp/women/shimabukuromiyuri/) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/miyuri_shi/)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n126579-aYXUMZi7ozKD.png'),(1630,'Shouya Ishige','[Profile (Intention)](https://intention-k.com/profile/shoya_ishige) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/ishige_syoya) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/syoya_ishige/)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n121940-VsqIg2qO2RXF.png'),(1631,'Kenichi Shimizu','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/i/user/351377726)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119190-Do77HxCrauIV.png'),(1632,'Ryuusei Nakao','[Profile (81 Produce)](https://www.81produce.co.jp/actor_search/index.php/item?cell003=%E3%81%AA%E8%A1%8C&label=1&cell004=&name=%E4%B8%AD%E5%B0%BE%E3%80%80%E9%9A%86%E8%81%96&id=89)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95259-A1sNVqfD2MWp.png'),(1633,'Hina Youmiya','[Profile (Aoni)](https://www.aoni.co.jp/search/yomiya-hina.html) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/Hina_Youmiya)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n205892-gaMHjeUijh84.png'),(1634,'Shun Horie','**Height:** 170 cm Received