orikawa-hikaru.html) | [Blog](http://hikaru23.hatenablog.com) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/greenriver_sr) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%B7%91%E5%B7%9D%E5%85%89)__ - Mirror Knight - Ultraman Zero (TV Series) - Wisure - Kishiryu Sentai Ryusolger (TV Series) - Leonhardt - The Legend of Heroes Series (VG) - [Rantarou Amami](https://anilist.co/character/131664/Rantarou-Amami) - Danganronpa V3 (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95112-c275OLptkSYO.png'),(1756,'Ayako Kawasumi',NULL,'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95013-854sZdHTaabG.png'),(1757,'Kousuke Okano','[Website](https://www.okanokousuke.com/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/okanokousuke) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kōsuke_Okano) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/岡野浩介) Okano Kousuke was formerly belonging to voice acting talent agency Production Baobab and is now freelance. He has also often featured on Japanese anime television network Animax as narrator along with fellow voice actress [Tamura Yukari](https://anilist.co/staff/95027).','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95434-xQdjmxXTMJcU.png'),(1758,'Noriyuki Abe',NULL,'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n105277-PzLpZFPtlWPd.png'),(1759,'Junko Noda','[Website](http://nodajun.com/) | [Twitter](https://x.com/NODA_JUN) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/nodajun/)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95277-hcE9l52SPjNP.jpg'),(1760,'Noriko Shitaya','[Profile](https://www.81produce.co.jp/actor_search/index.php/item?cell003=%E3%81%95%E8%A1%8C&cell029=%E5%A5%B3%E6%80%A7&keyword=&cell028=&cell004=&name=%E4%B8%8B%E5%B1%8B%E3%80%80%E5%89%87%E5%AD%90&id=214&label=1) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/shitaya_noriko) **Non-anime roles:**','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95120-XwX1WdxBi5C2.png'),(1761,'Ei Aoki','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/ei_aoki) Ei Aoki is a Japanese storyboard artist and director. He credits the anime [Megazone 23](https://anilist.co/anime/1935/Megazone-23) as his inspiration to have a career in animation. In 2013, he created the animation studio [TROYCA](https://anilist.co/studio/6068/TROYCA) with [Toshiyuki Nagano](https://anilist.co/staff/225498/Toshiyuki-Nagano) and [Tomonori Katou](https://anilist.co/staff/128695/Tomonori-Katou), which began animation production on its first work in the fall of 2014.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n107163-FYdQwXhP3T0m.png'),(1762,'Sayuri Yahagi','In 2015, she married a man who works in a company outside the voice-acting industry. [Profile](https://www.imenterprise.jp/profile.php?id=90) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/yahagi_sayuri)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95380-mOdqKPb6xYnI.png'),(1763,'Kenichi Kawamura',NULL,'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n118442-o1LwDJCrrZMM.jpg'),(1764,'Toshiyuki Katou','A regular presence in [David Production](https://anilist.co/studio/287/)\'s shows.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n106845-x1f5cBSXNAfC.png'),(1765,'Eri Kitamura','[Website](https://erikitamura.com/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/KITAxERI) | [King Records](http://king-cr.jp/artist/kitaeri/) A Japanese voice actress and singer. She used to be a child actress by the name of Eri Okamura. She is primarily known for her role in Blood+ as Saya Otonashi and singing \"Tsuyogari,\" the third ending for the anime series Konjiki No Gash Bell!! She is also known to be an amateur manga artist in Japan in her spare time. Kitamura is affiliated with talent agency Early Wing and was formerly affiliated with Kaleidoscope. Currently works in the music unit ARTERY VEIN with Asami Imai. She also provides the voice of CUL, a VOCALOID who debuted in VOCALOID3. **Non-Anime Roles:**','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95413-FwAIrc8Ishpt.png'),(1766,'Aki Toyosaki','[Website](http://www.toyosakiaki.com/) | [Profile](http://musicrayn.com/toyosaki_aki) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/toyosakiaki-blog/) | [Anison](http://anison.info/data/person/23897.html) | [Twitter](https://x.com/a_toyosaki_yoda) | [Bilibili](https://space.bilibili.com/48207005) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aki_Toyosaki) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B1%8A%E5%B4%8E%E6%84%9B%E7%94%9F) A voice actress and singer affiliated with Music Ray\'n. One of the members of [Sphere](https://anilist.co/staff/103636). **Non-Anime Roles:** • Navia - Genshin Impact (VG) • Crown - Goddess of Victory: Nikke (VG)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95599-XDGiluZB7IXL.png'),(1767,'Nobutoshi Kanna','[Agency Profile](https://www.aoni.co.jp/search/canna-nobutoshi.html) | [Twitter](https://x.com/ennen_7)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95096-7XONtZWj5lIw.png'),(1768,'Minami Takayama','[Profile (81 Produce)](https://www.81produce.co.jp/actor_search/index.php/item?id=237) | [Official blog](https://ameblo.jp/number-373/) The female half of the musical duo [TWO-MIX](https://anilist.co/staff/102352/). Married mangaka [Gosho Aoyama](https://anilist.co/staff/97804/) (creator of _Detective Conan_) on her birthday, May 5, in 2005. Later divorced on December 10, 2007. **Non-Anime Roles:** • Fu Hua (Honkai Impact 3rd)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95024-qsZgGp8VHqMP.png'),(1769,'Yuuko Miyamura','[Twitter](https://twitter.com/386miyamura) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDuFHS9IIiiOzEAgC-HIUdg) | [2nd YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvlLWnOfx-B61qC59MRLHDg/) | [VTuber Channel](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCb1IfpmmoKaVkp9ES_gBQjg) | [Blog](https://ameblo.jp/yuko-miyamura/) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Y%C5%ABko_Miyamura) Yūko Miyamura is a Japanese actress, voice actress, singer and sound director. She voices Miu Boude from the duo \'Miu and Sakura\' as a regional mascot for the city of Hannan, Osaka. • Chun-Li from Street Fighter (Video game series) • Larxene from Kingdom Hearts (Video game series) • Training video announcer from Battle Royale (live-action movie)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95458-u1OCiMNqiswq.png'),(1770,'Akiko Yajima','__[Profile (Air Agency)](https://www.air-agency.co.jp/talent/woman_allianc/akiko_yajima) | [Wiki (en)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Akiko_Yajima) | [Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/矢島晶子)__ Akiko Yajima is a Japanese voice actress. Her best-known role is as the title character Shinnosuke Nohara in the long-running anime series Crayon Shin-chan. On June 29, 2018, Akiko Yajima retired from her role as Shinnosuke Nohara\'s voice actress, with the role succeeded by [Yumiko Kobayashi](https://anilist.co/staff/95539). Non-anime roles:','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95148-JiNi79wg9ScS.png'),(1771,'Masuo Amada',NULL,'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95397-OIImp0s08L8m.jpg'),(1772,'Naohito Takahashi','[Wiki (jp)](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/高橋ナオヒト)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n105248-38FEWOQSiNSU.png'),(1773,'Shidou Nakamura','[Official Site](https://shidou.jp/) Mikihiro Ogawa, better known by the stage name Shidou Nakamura II is a Japanese kabuki and film actor.','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95292-Pp6Qcwd8zQUr.jpg'),(1774,'Ryou Naitou','[Profile](http://www.oginext.com/men/naito.html) | [Blog](http://blog.livedoor.jp/ryo0622ryo/)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95293-WMdddQNhHOt1.jpg'),(1775,'Kimiko Saitou','[Profile (Aoni Pro)](https://www.aoni.co.jp/search/saito-kimiko.html) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/kimikokimi) - Aurelia Dichala Dolce in \"Soul Calibur III\" (VG) (Japanese) - Miss Piggy in \"The Muppet Movie\" (live action movie) (Japanese) - Speed Buster in \"No More Heroes Paradise\" (VG) - Woman voice in \"Soul Calibur III\" (VG) (Japanese)','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95294-AN7KQALYLR9w.jpg'),(1776,'Ayumi Fujimura',NULL,'https://