ome seeking help, Justin realizes he must dust off his magical skills to mentor the wizard-in-training while also juggling his everyday responsibilities — and safeguarding the future of the Wizard World.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hrBpjFzIqmN9k7QxEC610gwZGw.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/TxicZcsiP9VHYXMYHm4IEHnwv9.jpg','completed','2024-10-29',35,27,'TV-G','2026-10-22 14:35:57'),(113,'The WONDERfools','series','A goofy group of townies stumbles into superpowers and fights rising evil as doomsday panic grows in this wild, turn-of-the-century action comedy.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jj7AYkz2OLRDL1wfJmjTXyWQ5I4.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/810mXC0xkxXVtoKIPGGVgO9PuLh.jpg','completed','2026-05-15',8,80,'TV-14','2026-10-22 14:35:58'),(114,'Avatar: The Last Airbender','series','In a war-torn world of elemental magic, a young boy reawakens to undertake a dangerous mystic quest to fulfill his destiny as the Avatar, and bring peace to the world.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaGt4GIutpbXHsv48tWceWg6s56.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/7oBGhqJIghRBvOwo5Qe0yM0cnMc.jpg','completed','2005-02-21',61,24,'TV-Y7','2026-10-22 14:35:59'),(115,'Arcane','series','Amid the stark discord of twin cities Piltover and Zaun, two sisters fight on rival sides of a war between magic technologies and clashing convictions.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87C0wecB8bHb1PsrKBI4kJiEkgV.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5cvnxEHT3e39DvT6ARw4GNCFrB0.jpg','completed','2021-11-06',18,51,'TV-14','2026-10-22 14:36:00'),(116,'The Pitt','series','The staff of Pittsburgh\'s Trauma Medical Center work around the clock to save lives in an overcrowded and underfunded emergency department.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvFSpESyBZMjaeOJDx7RS3P1jey.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/z3BkMbCy5ajZPMyKEUwsPHuz2cV.jpg','airing','2025-01-09',30,50,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:36:01'),(117,'Reply 1988','series','Take a nostalgic trip back to the late 1980s through the lives of five families and their five teenage kids living in a small neighbourhood in Seoul.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/655MownSWwplhvVlXERRJ4OSOG2.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/wgmikRStgBbrzjxFVe5rhFlpL2R.jpg','completed','2015-11-06',20,90,'TV-14','2026-10-22 14:36:03'),(118,'Chernobyl','series','The true story of one of the worst man-made catastrophes in history: the catastrophic nuclear accident at Chernobyl. A tale of the brave men and women who sacrificed to save Europe from unimaginable disaster.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlLXt2tOPT6RRnjiUmoxyG1LTFi.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/900tHlUYUkp7Ol04XFSoAaEIXcT.jpg','completed','2019-05-06',5,73,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:36:04'),(119,'Better Call Saul','series','Six years before Saul Goodman meets Walter White. We meet him when the man who will become Saul Goodman is known as Jimmy McGill, a small-time lawyer searching for his destiny, and, more immediately, hustling to make ends meet. Working alongside, and, often, against Jimmy, is “fixer” Mike Ehrmantraut. The series tracks Jimmy’s transformation into Saul Goodman, the man who puts “criminal” in “criminal lawyer\".','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fC2HDm5t0kHl7mTm7jxMR31b7by.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/rfxryDIv8huejujg4JueDJx8zCz.jpg','completed','2015-02-08',63,70,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:36:05'),(120,'Heated Rivalry','series','Two of the biggest stars in Major League Hockey are bound by ambition, rivalry, and a magnetic pull neither of them fully understands. What begins as a secret fling between two fresh faced rookies evolves into a years-long journey of love, denial, and self-discovery. Over the next eight years, as they chase glory on the ice, they struggle to navigate their feelings for each other. Torn between the sport they live for and the love they can’t ignore, they must decide if there’s room in their fiercely competitive world for something as fragile – and powerful – as real love.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p