fessional relationship with psychiatrist Jennifer Melfi. The show features Tony\'s family members and Mafia associates in prominent roles and story arcs, most notably his wife Carmela and his cousin and protégé Christopher Moltisanti.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTc7ZXdroqjkKivFPvCPX0Ru7uw.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lNpkvX2s8LGB0mjGODMT4o6Up7j.jpg','completed','1999-01-10',86,61,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:36:11'),(126,'The Amazing Digital Circus','series','A woman finds herself trapped in a virtual circus where she and five other humans are subject to the whims of a wacky AI ringmaster. In this digital purgatory they must face frightening NPCs and cope with their own personal traumas.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpfrgfomX8uNFxv4VaEzvJGs9TK.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/vPVdWiLUNQyaGMazyZGVAyRcYBG.jpg','completed','2023-10-13',9,59,'TV-14','2026-10-22 14:36:12'),(127,'Cosmos: A Personal Voyage','series','Carl Sagan covers a wide range of scientific subjects, including the origin of life and a perspective of our place in the universe.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOGArjE0WMkzY2GW1taJm8l9gxD.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/hjJ5XDKP7XY2ADUuMdHM5NsC32s.jpg','completed','1980-09-28',13,60,NULL,'2026-10-22 14:36:13'),(128,'Adventure Time: Fionna and Cake','series','Fionna and Cake – with the help of the former Ice King, Simon Petrikov - embark on a multiverse-hopping adventure and journey of self-discovery. All the while a powerful new antagonist determined to track them down and erase them from existence, lurks in the shadows.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fi1b6U1kp73xheECzqwzMn8u3mX.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/vRAM2el4bAygzUWfwXdt34E71Ee.jpg','airing','2023-08-31',20,26,'TV-14','2026-10-22 14:36:14'),(129,'Primal','series','A caveman forms a bond with a dinosaur as they struggle to survive in a hostile world.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mf12pRakr3eYdJtv6klQtoznnbU.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zBfnpI8