b.org/t/p/w1280/bhF63Jd90gRYyTHd4y5GCGA2vX6.jpg','completed','2010-09-06',245,11,'TV-PG','2026-10-22 14:36:18'),(134,'Planet Earth','series','David Attenborough celebrates the amazing variety of the natural world in this epic documentary series, filmed over four years across 64 different countries.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNcNxUtZ520d5de5s78onoiSiwQ.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/qmRUwosX4BsCj6QanpBYScLl3Sp.jpg','completed','2006-03-05',11,53,'TV-PG','2026-10-22 14:36:18'),(135,'31 Minutes','series','The program focuses on the adventures of the team of a low-prestige newscast, where something unexpected always happens. Their notes, while some are quite ridiculous, others are educational and leave a message both explicitly and implicitly. The news program is hosted by Tulio Triviño.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rI0hXEJFcgRaigCWGEuqEXQvOjY.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ooFdkopLCwPp42zymuM9syg8M22.jpg','completed','2003-03-15',68,33,'NR','2026-10-22 14:36:20'),(136,'Bon Appétit, Your Majesty','series','After time traveling to the Joseon era, a talented chef meets a tyrant king. Her modern dishes captivate his palate, but royal challenges await her.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exUXEOierAwZ597010TLQka9TFy.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ttbmzTZHTzqDK4JniKonMrsQath.jpg','completed','2025-08-23',12,83,'TV-14','2026-10-22 14:36:21'),(137,'Run BTS!','series','Run BTS! is a variety web series starring BTS, broadcasting intermittent for free viewing on Weverse and YouTube, was formerly offered weekly for free viewing on V LIVE.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xi6fnObkhQI7onZWeSB9rA80Abs.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/c8dm74uPCMA27iKAR1WnHKTsI9h.jpg','airing','2015-08-01',175,30,NULL,'2026-10-22 14:36:22'),(138,'Blue Planet II','series','There is nowhere more powerful and unforgiving yet more beautiful and compelling than the ocean. Join us and explore the greatest yet least known parts of our planet.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1NsoYYDYHnPkRr7Enqr8tlexgO.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/1nfIEJu02Zhv9omTKkzwHnK8Dji.jpg','completed','2017-10-29',7,60,'TV-G','2026-10-22 14:36:22'),(139,'Once','series','The series revolves around Gabo, a soccer-loving teenager who, upon receiving a scholarship from the prestigious Sports Academic Institute (IAD) of Buenos Aires, will see his dream of playing at Los Halcones Dorados, the renowned amateur team of the school, and also his longing to become a professional footballer.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4vPg3QsTJJh6C5MHARTb5CyqOu.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/yLyKDdCqSuUXWhAW3TtoXTvmpHo.jpg','completed','2017-06-19',220,NULL,'NR','2026-10-22 14:36:23'),(140,'INVINCIBLE','series','Mark Grayson is a normal teenager except for the fact that his father is the most powerful superhero on the planet. Shortly after his seventeenth birthday, Mark begins to develop powers of his own and enters into his father\'s tutelage.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tblBrslcKSifMVZ3TmtT2ukMor.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9qrroces8C6R9aKr08hACNPVXdZ.jpg','airing','2021-03-25',32,52,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:36:24'),(141,'The Spectacular Spider-Man','series','Having spent the summer engaging common criminals with his new-found powers, not so typical 16-year-old Peter Parker must conceal his secret identity and battle super-villains in the real world as he enters his junior year of high school.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCNxOhXT7c4lqYuRpdM3m8s9XDp.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/fypGcrQCyb9vQ7L8AM6PHCjQSBC.jpg','completed','2008-03-08',26,22,'TV-Y7','2026-10-22 14:36:25'),(142,'Wizards of Waverly Place','series','Alex, Justin and Max Russo are not your ordinary kids - they\'re wizards in training! While their parents run the Waverly Sub Station, the siblings struggle to balance their ordinary lives while learning to master their extraordinary powers.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spVI8Zns4Ep30zzxcoO7f7nwfck.jpg','https