he new philosophy teacher, Merlí, who will help his students view the world in a whole new light, both in and out of the classroom.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQaGnuwIHhmB1jgY6CM3rJgScYR.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/1p7cUZ0X9YXX4FZ4aTdLYLdH64S.jpg','completed','2015-09-14',40,40,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:36:34'),(152,'Alchemy of Souls','series','She was named Naksu because wherever she went, a trail of heads followed. She performs the alchemy of souls, magic that can change people\'s bodies and souls, which is forbidden in Daeho, and ends up being chased. Naksu hurriedly abandons her body and attempts the alchemy of souls on a woman passing by. Jang Wook, the son of the King of Daeho, realizes that Mudeok\'s soul has been changed and helps her. Jang Wook wants to learn Naksu\'s martial arts and become a sorcerer, and Naksu, in the body of Mudeok, stays by his side so she can recover her strength.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvOZN1NlAoL8iz9ghpES1zWA3w3.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/nBZyWSGAUEzCH7Mna0zUNTpBQlQ.jpg','completed','2022-06-18',30,75,'TV-14','2026-10-22 14:36:35'),(153,'Batman: The Animated Series','series','Vowing to avenge the murder of his parents, Bruce Wayne devotes his life to wiping out crime in Gotham City as the masked vigilante \"Batman\".','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBomQFW1vlm1yUYMNSbFZ45R4Ox.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4QnFxk03yAn7U2ZTL5oMCCqxlPc.jpg','completed','1992-09-05',85,22,'TV-PG','2026-10-22 14:36:36'),(154,'The Office','series','The everyday lives of office employees in the Scranton, Pennsylvania branch of the fictional Dunder Mifflin Paper Company.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DJKHzAi83BmQrWLrYYOqcoKfhR.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9vMzIrMIncPmtalcxh1MOrgcE6C.jpg','completed','2005-03-24',186,45,'TV-14','2026-10-22 14:36:37'),(155,'The Originals','series','The Vampire Diaries spin-off that follows the Mikaelsons, a family of millennia-old, power-hungry vampires who want 