uth Korean heiress in North Korea -- and into the life of an army officer, who decides he will help her hide.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgBNLPr6mC8pxuR79ENAJY4nBmj.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3yEHM2HT2vrUtO93YzTJNgEfiZG.jpg','completed','2019-12-14',16,113,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:36:53'),(172,'The Rookie','series','Starting over isn\'t easy, especially for small-town guy John Nolan who, after a life-altering incident, is pursuing his dream of being an LAPD officer. As the force\'s oldest rookie, he\'s met with skepticism from some higher-ups who see him as just a walking midlife crisis.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70kTz0OmjjZe7zHvIDrq2iKW7PJ.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6iNWfGVCEfASDdlNb05TP5nG0ll.jpg','airing','2018-10-16',145,43,'TV-14','2026-10-22 14:36:54'),(173,'The Amazing World of Gumball','series','The life of Gumball Watterson, a 12-year old cat who attends middle school in Elmore. Accompanied by his pet, adoptive brother, and best friend Darwin Watterson, he frequently finds himself involved in various shenanigans around the city, during which he interacts with various family members: Anais, Richard, and Nicole Watterson, and other various citizens.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VYnnyA2hyxi3VUPgCA71mMtt69.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/gmO3aezFgDcrhcymhNSJLGZ3CT.jpg','completed','2011-05-03',240,11,'TV-Y7','2026-10-22 14:36:55'),(174,'Generator Rex','series','In a future where humans are infected by untested, microscopic robots, Generator Rex, an average teenager with the ability to turn his body into amazing machines, helps the secret organization Providence save the world from the nanite threat and dangerous EVO monsters.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3F93j1Yuu9wtPO06BlPSVbLdxaP.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/jXiKtz7PPWOI4zKl5CdtrKyLUh8.jpg','completed','2010-04-23',59,30,'TV-PG','2026-10-22 14:36:56'),(175,'MobLand','series','Two mob families clash in a war that threatens to topple empires and lives.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Xc7WpWsgflfgEMoBlf9TmWhfbH.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/h0OC7ouop8YLwbAVfS3UUE2Lw4T.jpg','airing','2025-03-30',20,38,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:36:57'),(176,'My Mister','series','In a world that is less than kind, a young woman and a middle-aged man develop a sense of kinship as they find warmth and comfort in one another.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gE9tZDycsA31wvtzUcDWVk6Nf7t.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/i7prwa7UwOAUcpTmWnUd75J2PWe.jpg','completed','2018-03-21',16,90,'TV-14','2026-10-22 14:36:57'),(177,'BoJack Horseman','series','Meet the most beloved sitcom horse of the \'90s , 20 years later. He\'s a curmudgeon with a heart of...not quite gold...but something like gold. Copper?','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JFWzlChcGgLiIUo2COgNlWGFKy.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/81BCTObfPk0EvarJpUgnGXHvM9x.jpg','completed','2014-08-22',76,27,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:36:58'),(178,'Our Planet','series','Experience our planet\'s natural beauty and examine how climate change impacts all living creatures in this ambitious documentary of spectacular scope.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRSnArnQBmeUYb5GWDU595bGsBr.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/p8EUX6MPSNLxVwqO3fCYTi896Ro.jpg','completed','2019-04-05',12,50,'TV-PG','2026-10-22 14:36:59'),(179,'Hidden Love','series','Since high school, Sang Zhi has had a crush on Duan Jiaxu. When fate brings them together again, they find a chance to embark on a sweet relationship.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riGzESa9N9toumP9OhMmg0QvFPD.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/wQlJJJ50gKphCci0SmoetUXmJN4.jpg','completed','2023-06-20',25,45,'น 13+','2026-10-22 14:37:00'),(180,'Smiling Friends','series','Smiling Friends Inc. is a small company whose main purpose is to bring happiness and make people smile. The series follows the day-to-day lives and misadventures of its representatives, the lazy, cynical Charlie, and the cheerful, optimistic Pim, as they try to cheer up and comfort the troubled people who call their company\'s hotline. They receive seemingly simple requests but the jobs turn out to be more complicated than they seem, making it difficult to bring happiness to the world.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3CSxl3G06MBc73TpHWwBYYTPxL.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/qjHTkQ3QUlw6sxkIhugqNYsRJnR.jpg','completed','2020-04-01',27,11,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:37:00'),(181,'Peaky Blinders','series','A gangster family epic set in 1919 Birmingham, England and centered on a gang who sew razor blades in the peaks of their caps, and their fierce boss Tommy Shelby, who means to move up in the world.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUUqzWa2LnHIVqkaKVlVGkVcZIW.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/dzq83RHwQcnP6WGJ6YkenIqeaa5.jpg','completed','2013-09-12',36,79,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:37:01'),(182,'No Gain No Love','series','Son Hae-yeong seeks out a fake wedding with her neighbourhood convenience store employee, Kim Ji-uk, to avoid missing out on a promotion.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ru3ZYJpzbmv2VpGsj1rmO5Hcpky.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6q52MB16qAXVqr3EkPcsHAXUAdg.jpg','completed','2024-08-26',12,78,NULL,'2026-10-22 14:37:02'),(183,'Bloodhounds','series','Faced with ruthless foes with a violent thirst, two young boxers band together — risking life and limb to bring justice and protect their loved ones.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSQzD7TXsL96J5ggDrJFdUs8uXU.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zhsEnDNCQX5dlI2wbKzV90pV0B9.jpg','completed','2023-06-09',15,61,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:37:03'),(184,'Moving','series','Children who live in hiding with superpowers, along with their parents who live with painful secrets of the past, face enormous dangers together.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vf9SNXNAFqzKBGksFwrXhkg9cb7.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/29jWaRhKtey1efp5G7Fu97NAmzz.jpg','airing','2023-08-09',21,46,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:37:04'),(185,'A Shop for Killers','series','A niece who lost her parents and grew up in the hands of an uncle who runs a shopping mall faces a new truth after her uncle\'s sudden death.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yUY1HUyQuybbvkAAhLzQ7x1l9g.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lg134VJrvY3ZdOlP4lTu1onOhcf.jpg','completed','2024-01-17',16,61,'TV-MA','2026-10-22 14:37:05'),(186,'Cosmos','series','Famed astrophysicist Neil deGrasse Tyson provides clarity for the vision of the cosmos as he voyages across the universe with never-before-told stories that delve into the scientific concepts of the laws of gravity and the origins of space and time.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5o07ps0QZ0bNoRYxTn9cPdRWlUu.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/2Nwbv0hrN8sThLvgooShcPqmFrO.jpg','completed','2014-03-09',26,43,'TV-G','2026-10-22 14:37:06'),(187,'The Twilight Zone','series','An anthology series containing drama, psychological thriller, fantasy, science fiction, suspense, and/or horror, often concluding with a macabre or unexpected twist.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uY4pCOxbEdv4M8jTE4uMPVoSIW.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zAgcM7zwWAVOIT9dMMzQx7e4vdX.jpg','completed','1959-10-02',156,25,'TV-PG','2026-10-22 14:37:06'),(188,'Clarkson\'s Farm','series','Follow Jeremy Clarkson as he embarks on his latest adventure, farming. The man who on several occasions claims to be allergic to manual labour takes on the most manually labour intensive job there is. What could possibly go wrong?','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toVhyqMT3ICfahE7Ad8obJvZHpX.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/i50h4Gz6e9BMGak5l6gg5qfIjcv.jpg','airing','2021-06-11',40,71,'TV-PG','2026-10-22 14:37:07'),(189,'Scarlet Heart: Ryeo','series','A story of a 25-year-old Go Hajin who is transported back in time to the Goryeo Dynasty. She then wakes up in the body of Lady Hae Soo and finds herself amongst the ruling princes of the Wang Family.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTW7wLyD95JRCyUEdTfxCWQWsvd.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/yBmqsAFjJJtdHk